### 16. This agent's website widgets — see widget.http

### 17. This agent's knowledge base — see knowledgebase.http

### 18. Get Agent Pronunciation & Phonetic Dictionary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1/pronunciation
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 19. Update Agent Pronunciation Rules
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1/pronunciation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "rules": [
    {
      "word": "MCHJ",
      "replacement": "mas'uliyati cheklangan jamiyat",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "language": "uz"
    },
    {
      "word": "100k",
      "replacement": "yuz ming",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "language": "uz"
    },
    {
      "word": "Uzcard",
      "replacement": "uz kard",
      "caseSensitive": false,
      "language": "*"
    }
  ]
}

### 20. Get Agent Post-Call Actions & Automated Follow-ups
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1/post-call-actions
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 21. Update Agent Post-Call Actions
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1/post-call-actions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "order-sms",
      "name": "Buyurtma tasdiq SMS",
      "actionType": "SEND_SMS",
      "triggerDisposition": "COMPLETED",
      "onlyOnSuccess": true,
      "template": "Assalomu alaykum! Buyurtmangiz qabul qilindi. Xulosa: {{summary}}",
      "webhookUrl": null,
      "headers": null,
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "crm-webhook",
      "name": "CRM Sync Webhook",
      "actionType": "WEBHOOK",
      "triggerDisposition": null,
      "onlyOnSuccess": false,
      "template": null,
      "webhookUrl": "https://crm.example.com/api/call-completed",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer crm_secret"
      },
      "enabled": true
    }
  ]
}

### 22. Company secrets a webhook or tool refers to — see secret.http

### 23. Realtime agent: engine first, then that engine's model.
### Swap llmModel for gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-latest to run the other Gemini Live model.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "pipelineMode": "REALTIME",
  "realtimeProvider": "gemini-live",
  "llmModel": "gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview"
}

### 24. ...and the pair is enforced: an OpenAI Realtime model on a Gemini Live agent
### is refused with 400 REALTIME_MODEL_PROVIDER_MISMATCH rather than failing at call time.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "pipelineMode": "REALTIME",
  "realtimeProvider": "gemini-live",
  "llmModel": "gpt-realtime-2.1"
}

### 25. Cascade agent: the cheap model a one-word turn is answered on.
### Blank (or absent) leaves the installation default, DIALOG_FAST_MODEL.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Uysot qarz undirish",
  "pipelineMode": "CASCADE",
  "llmModel": "gemini-3.8-flash",
  "fastLlmModel": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
}

### 26. ...and how an agent opts out of the downgrade: same id as llmModel.
### There is no separate off switch — a collections agent that cannot afford a weaker
### model on "ha" says so by naming the same model twice.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Uysot qarz undirish",
  "pipelineMode": "CASCADE",
  "llmModel": "gemini-3.8-flash",
  "fastLlmModel": "gemini-3.8-flash"
}

### 27. An id that is not in the LLM catalog is refused at save (400 AI_MODEL_UNKNOWN),
### the same check llmModel goes through.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ai-agents/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Uysot qarz undirish",
  "pipelineMode": "CASCADE",
  "fastLlmModel": "gemini-1.0-nano"
}
